      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As you may already know\r\nTell has been suffering from a mysterious plague\r\nfor some time now",
        "Jp" : "すでに知っているかもしれないが\r\nテルはここしばらく謎の疫病に\r\n苦しめられている"
