      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "In truth, in days past an incident befell the\r\nvillage — and the very one most deeply involved\r\nwas the cleric of the Hidell Church.",
        "Jp" : "実は、過去に村である事件が起きてな――\r\nそれと深く関わるのが、ハイデル教会の\r\n司祭だったのだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 284777,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
