      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "One thing more. If hazardous monsters that\r\nthreaten Hidell lurk in the depths, I would have\r\nyou deal with them as well.",
        "Jp" : "もうひとつ、奥にハイデルにとって脅威となりうる\r\n危険な魔物がいればその対処も頼みたい"
