      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If you are able to conduct the Catacombs\r\ninvestigation, I shall guarantee that your\r\nreputation shall spread further. I rely upon you\r\nto attend to it, and pray you may see it\r\nthrough with diligence.",
        "Jp" : "霊廟調査を成し得たならば、\r\n貴君の名声はさらに広まると保証しよう\r\nよろしく頼む"
